---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Julie Bale"
  description="Terms and Conditions for Julie Bale's programmes and services at juliebale.com."
>
  <Hero
    height="banner"
    bgColor="var(--color-charcoal)"
    heading="Terms &amp; Conditions"
    subheading="The terms that govern your use of this website and my services."
    textColor="light"
  />

  <section class="section legal-section">
    <div class="container legal-body">
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: April 2026</p>

      <h2>About These Terms</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms and Conditions govern your use of juliebale.com and your engagement with
        Julie Bale's programmes and services. By using this website or purchasing any programme,
        you agree to these terms. Please read them carefully.
      </p>
      <p>
        "Julie Bale", "I", "me" and "my" refer to Julie Bale, trading as Diva Energy®.
        "You" and "your" refer to the visitor or client.
      </p>

      <h2>Services</h2>
      <p>
        I offer vocal coaching, performance coaching, clinical hypnotherapy, and related programmes
        and resources. Specific terms for individual programmes (including session schedules,
        refund policies, and programme delivery details) are set out at the point of purchase.
      </p>

      <h2>Bookings & Payment</h2>
      <p>
        Programme enrolments and bookings are processed via Kajabi at members.juliebale.com.
        Payment is required at the time of booking unless a payment plan is explicitly offered.
        All prices are stated in pounds sterling (GBP) and include VAT where applicable.
      </p>

      <h2>Cancellation & Refunds</h2>
      <p>
        Cancellation and refund terms vary by programme and are communicated clearly at the point
        of purchase. In general:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Individual sessions cancelled with less than 24 hours' notice are non-refundable.</li>
        <li>Programme enrolments may be subject to cooling-off periods under UK consumer law (14 days for digital products purchased online).</li>
        <li>Group programme places are non-transferable without prior agreement.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        If you have a query about a specific booking, please <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All content on this website — including text, images, the Diva Energy® brand, the BRAVO
        Framework® name and methodology, and all programme materials — is owned by or licensed to
        Julie Bale. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works from any content
        without my written permission.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        My coaching and hypnotherapy services are for personal development and performance
        enhancement. They are not a substitute for medical, psychological, or psychiatric treatment.
        If you have a medical condition or mental health concern, please consult a qualified
        healthcare professional.
      </p>
      <p>
        Results from coaching and hypnotherapy vary from person to person. I cannot guarantee
        specific outcomes.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, I shall not be liable for any indirect,
        incidental, or consequential loss arising from your use of this website or my services.
        My total liability to you shall not exceed the amount you have paid to me in the 12
        months preceding the claim.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms and Conditions are governed by the laws of England and Wales. Any disputes
        shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>
        I may update these Terms and Conditions from time to time. Continued use of this website
        or my services following any changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For any questions about these terms, please use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-section {
    background-color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .legal-body {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .legal-updated {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-teal-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .legal-body h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-10);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    padding-top: var(--space-6);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-body h2:first-of-type {
    border-top: none;
    margin-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-body p,
  .legal-body li {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-grey);
    line-height: var(--leading-loose);
  }

  .legal-body ul {
    padding-left: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .legal-body li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .legal-body a {
    color: var(--color-teal-muted);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .legal-body a:hover {
    color: var(--color-gold);
  }
</style>
